\/04-realitykitintegration","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"50min","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/04-RealityKitIntegration","title":"Spatial Layout 예제를 RealityKit 장면으로 확장하기","kind":"project","role":"project"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/03-PlanetInfoOverlay":{"abstract":[{"text":"앞 장에서 움직이던 태양계에 행성 설명과 선택 기능을 추가합니다. ","type":"text"},{"code":"TimelineView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"와 ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlanetOrbitView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"를 이어서 사용하고, 선택한 행성의 3D 경계에 정보 카드를 배치합니다.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/03-planetinfooverlay","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"25min","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/03-PlanetInfoOverlay","title":"선택한 행성 가까이에 정보를 띄우기","kind":"project","role":"project"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/02-PlanetRotation":{"type":"topic","title":"정적인 배치에 시간 축 더하기","abstract":[{"text":"앞에서 만든 ","type":"text"},{"code":"Planet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"과 z축 이동량을 이어받아 자전과 공전을 더합니다. 모델의 자전은 ","type":"text"},{"code":"rotation3DLayout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"으로, 공전 위치는 시간에 따른 좌표로 표현하고, 태양과 여덟 행성을 같은 중심에 배치합니다.","type":"text"}],"kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/02-PlanetRotation","role":"project","estimatedTime":"25min","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/02-planetrotation"},"interaction-flow.svg":{"variants":[{"svgID":"title","traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/interaction-flow.svg"}],"identifier":"interaction-flow.svg","type":"image","alt":"행성 탭이 선택 상태를 바꾸고 정보 카드를 표시하는 흐름도"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%97%94%ED%8B%B0%ED%8B%B0%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EA%B3%BC-%ED%81%AC%EA%B8%B0-%ED%86%B5%EC%9D%BC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"type":"section","title":"엔티티의 이름과 크기 통일하기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 3을 마친 프로젝트에서 이어갑니다. "},{"code":"Planet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"code":"PlanetInfoCard","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"를 사용하면서 태양계를 그리는 화면을 "},{"code":"RealityView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"로 옮깁니다. 지름 정규화, 장면 생성과 갱신, 이름 레이블, 공간 탭을 순서대로 연결합니다."}],"kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%97%94%ED%8B%B0%ED%8B%B0%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EA%B3%BC-%ED%81%AC%EA%B8%B0-%ED%86%B5%EC%9D%BC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/04-realitykitintegration#%EC%97%94%ED%8B%B0%ED%8B%B0%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EA%B3%BC-%ED%81%AC%EA%B8%B0-%ED%86%B5%EC%9D%BC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics":{"estimatedTime":"35min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode에서 새 visionOS 프로젝트를 만드는 것부터 시작합니다. RealityKitContent 에셋과 Swift 파일을 차례로 준비한 뒤, 태양과 여덟 행성을 불러와 깊이 축에 배치합니다."}],"kind":"project","role":"project","title":"깊이 축을 가진 태양계의 첫 장면","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics","type":"topic"},"03-overlay-start.swift":{"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct PlanetOrbitView: View {","    let planet: Planet","    let time: TimeInterval","    var isSelected: Bool = false","    var select: () -> Void = { }","","    private var orbitAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.orbitDuration","        ) \/ planet.orbitDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360)","    }","","    private var spinAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.rotationDuration","        ) \/ planet.rotationDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360 * planet.rotationDirection)","    }","","    private var orbitX: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(cos(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    private var orbitDepth: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(sin(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    var body: some View {","        PlanetModelView(assetName: planet.assetName)","            \/\/ 자전은 모델에만 적용합니다.","            .rotation3DLayout(spinAngle, axis: .y)","            .scaleEffect(isSelected ? 1.12 : 1)","            .hoverEffect()","            .onTapGesture(perform: select)","            \/\/ 카드도 같은 위치로 이동하도록 자전·오버레이 뒤에 적용합니다.","            .offset(x: orbitX, y: -orbitDepth * 0.3)","            .offset(z: planet.depth + orbitDepth * 0.6)","    }","}"],"type":"file","highlights":[{"line":6},{"line":7},{"line":35},{"line":36},{"line":37},{"line":38}],"fileType":"swift","fileName":"PlanetOrbitView.swift","identifier":"03-overlay-start.swift","syntax":"swift"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/Spatial-Layout-------":{"abstract":[],"kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/Spatial-Layout-------","title":"Spatial Layout 기초 다지기","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/spatial-layout-------","type":"topic"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/03-PlanetInfoOverlay#%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C%EB%A5%BC-%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%A1%9C-%EB%AA%A8%EC%9C%BC%EA%B8%B0":{"type":"section","title":"선택 상태를 하나로 모으기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"앞 장에서 움직이던 태양계에 행성 설명과 선택 기능을 추가합니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimelineView"},{"type":"text","text":"와 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetOrbitView"},{"type":"text","text":"를 이어서 사용하고, 선택한 행성의 3D 경계에 정보 카드를 배치합니다."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/03-PlanetInfoOverlay#%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C%EB%A5%BC-%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%A1%9C-%EB%AA%A8%EC%9C%BC%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/03-planetinfooverlay#%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C%EB%A5%BC-%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%A1%9C-%EB%AA%A8%EC%9C%BC%EA%B8%B0"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 3을 마친 프로젝트에서 이어갑니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Planet"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetInfoCard"},{"type":"text","text":"를 사용하면서 태양계를 그리는 화면을 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"type":"text","text":"로 옮깁니다. 지름 정규화, 장면 생성과 갱신, 이름 레이블, 공간 탭을 순서대로 연결합니다."}],"kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0","title":"장면 생성과 프레임 갱신 나누기","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/04-realitykitintegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0","type":"section"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"type":"section","title":"여기까지 확인하기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode에서 새 visionOS 프로젝트를 만드는 것부터 시작합니다. RealityKitContent 에셋과 Swift 파일을 차례로 준비한 뒤, 태양과 여덟 행성을 불러와 깊이 축에 배치합니다."}],"kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},"03-planet-summary.swift":{"content":["import Foundation","","struct Planet: Identifiable, Hashable {","    let name: String","    let assetName: String","    let summary: String","    let depth: CGFloat","    let orbitRadius: CGFloat","    let orbitDuration: TimeInterval","    let rotationDuration: TimeInterval","    let rotationDirection: Double","","    var id: String { assetName }","","    static let starter: [Planet] = [","        .init(name: \"수성\", assetName: \"Mercury\", summary: \"태양에 가장 가까운 행성\", depth: -70, orbitRadius: 56, orbitDuration: 8, rotationDuration: 2.4, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"금성\", assetName: \"Venus\", summary: \"두꺼운 대기를 가진 암석 행성\", depth: -50, orbitRadius: 84, orbitDuration: 12, rotationDuration: 3.8, rotationDirection: -1),","        .init(name: \"지구\", assetName: \"Earth\", summary: \"액체 상태의 바다가 있는 행성\", depth: -30, orbitRadius: 112, orbitDuration: 16, rotationDuration: 2.8, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"화성\", assetName: \"Mars\", summary: \"산화철 때문에 붉게 보이는 행성\", depth: -10, orbitRadius: 140, orbitDuration: 20, rotationDuration: 3, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"목성\", assetName: \"Jupiter\", summary: \"태양계에서 가장 큰 가스 행성\", depth: 10, orbitRadius: 172, orbitDuration: 25, rotationDuration: 2.2, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"토성\", assetName: \"Saturn\", summary: \"뚜렷한 고리로 알려진 가스 행성\", depth: 30, orbitRadius: 204, orbitDuration: 30, rotationDuration: 2.5, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"천왕성\", assetName: \"Uranus\", summary: \"자전축이 크게 기울어진 얼음 행성\", depth: 50, orbitRadius: 236, orbitDuration: 36, rotationDuration: 3.2, rotationDirection: -1),","        .init(name: \"해왕성\", assetName: \"Neptune\", summary: \"빠른 바람이 부는 얼음 행성\", depth: 70, orbitRadius: 268, orbitDuration: 42, rotationDuration: 3.1, rotationDirection: 1)","    ]","}"],"fileType":"swift","fileName":"Planet.swift","identifier":"03-planet-summary.swift","highlights":[{"line":6},{"line":16},{"line":17},{"line":18},{"line":19},{"line":20},{"line":21},{"line":22},{"line":23}],"type":"file","syntax":"swift"},"03-spatial-overlay.swift":{"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct PlanetOrbitView: View {","    let planet: Planet","    let time: TimeInterval","    var isSelected: Bool = false","    var select: () -> Void = { }","","    private var orbitAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.orbitDuration","        ) \/ planet.orbitDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360)","    }","","    private var spinAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.rotationDuration","        ) \/ planet.rotationDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360 * planet.rotationDirection)","    }","","    private var orbitX: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(cos(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    private var orbitDepth: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(sin(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    var body: some View {","        PlanetModelView(assetName: planet.assetName)","            \/\/ 자전은 모델에만 적용합니다.","            .rotation3DLayout(spinAngle, axis: .y)","            .scaleEffect(isSelected ? 1.12 : 1)","            .hoverEffect()","            .onTapGesture(perform: select)","            .spatialOverlay(alignment: .bottomFront) {","                if isSelected {","                    PlanetInfoCard(planet: planet, dismiss: select)","                        .offset(z: 12)","                }","            }","            \/\/ 카드도 같은 위치로 이동하도록 자전·오버레이 뒤에 적용합니다.","            .offset(x: orbitX, y: -orbitDepth * 0.3)","            .offset(z: planet.depth + orbitDepth * 0.6)","    }","}"],"type":"file","highlights":[{"line":38},{"line":39},{"line":40},{"line":41},{"line":42},{"line":43}],"fileType":"swift","fileName":"PlanetOrbitView.swift","identifier":"03-spatial-overlay.swift","syntax":"swift"},"03-selection-animation.swift":{"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct SolarSystemView: View {","    @State private var selectedPlanet: Planet?","","    var body: some View {","        TimelineView(.animation) { timeline in","            let now = timeline.date.timeIntervalSinceReferenceDate","","            \/\/ 태양과 행성의 중심을 같은 3D 공간에 놓습니다.","            SpatialContainer(alignment: .center) {","                PlanetModelView(assetName: \"Sun\")","","                ForEach(Planet.starter) { planet in","                    PlanetOrbitView(","                        planet: planet,","                        time: now,","                        isSelected: selectedPlanet?.id == planet.id,","                        select: {","                            withAnimation(.easeInOut(duration: 0.2)) {","                                selectedPlanet = selectedPlanet?.id == planet.id","                                    ? nil","                                    : planet","                            }","                        }","                    )","                }","            }","            .frame(width: 800, height: 380)","            .frame(depth: 620)","            .padding3D(24)","        }","    }","}"],"fileType":"swift","fileName":"SolarSystemView.swift","identifier":"03-selection-animation.swift","highlights":[{"line":20},{"line":21},{"line":22},{"line":23},{"line":24}],"type":"file","syntax":"swift"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/03-PlanetInfoOverlay#3D-%EA%B2%BD%EA%B3%84-%EC%95%88%EC%97%90-%EC%B9%B4%EB%93%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A0%95%EB%A0%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"type":"section","title":"3D 경계 안에 카드를 정렬하기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"앞 장에서 움직이던 태양계에 행성 설명과 선택 기능을 추가합니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimelineView"},{"type":"text","text":"와 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetOrbitView"},{"type":"text","text":"를 이어서 사용하고, 선택한 행성의 3D 경계에 정보 카드를 배치합니다."}],"kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/03-PlanetInfoOverlay#3D-%EA%B2%BD%EA%B3%84-%EC%95%88%EC%97%90-%EC%B9%B4%EB%93%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A0%95%EB%A0%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/03-planetinfooverlay#3D-%EA%B2%BD%EA%B3%84-%EC%95%88%EC%97%90-%EC%B9%B4%EB%93%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A0%95%EB%A0%AC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"}}}